{
  "id": "304",
  "title": "Making A Fuss Over Small Things",
  "level": "intermediate",
  "date": "2017-08-06",
  "synopsis": "Little Wang injures his hand at work, but how badly injured is he really?",
  "audioUrl": "https://static.duchinese.net/documents/492/354e1598e6b52c1a55f08a04dc8ca9718429da5a.mp3?1500800468",
  "series": null,
  "fullText": {
    "simplified": "小题大做\n\n    “小题大做”是一个成语，你知道它的意思吗？先来听听这个故事。\n    小王做事很喜欢小题大做。有一次，他的手不小心被刀割破了，他吵着要去医院。他的同事和他到了医院后，医生看着他的手很认真地说：“还好你们来得早，再晚一点，你的手就好了。”\n    现在你知道“小题大做”的意思了吗？“小题大做”是指把小事当作大事来办，有不值得这样做的意思。",
    "traditional": "小題大做\n\n    “小題大做”是一個成語，你知道它的意思嗎？先來聽聽這個故事。\n    小王做事很喜歡小題大做。有一次，他的手不小心被刀割破了，他吵著要去醫院。他的同事和他到了醫院後，醫生看著他的手很認真地說：“還好你們來得早，再晚一點，你的手就好了。”\n    現在你知道“小題大做”的意思了嗎？“小題大做”是指把小事當作大事來辦，有不值得這樣做的意思。"
  },
  "sentences": [
    {
      "index": 1,
      "simplified": "\n\n    ",
      "traditional": "\n\n    ",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Making A Fuss Over Small Things"
    },
    {
      "index": 2,
      "simplified": "“小题大做”是一个成语，你知道它的意思吗？",
      "traditional": "“小題大做”是一個成語，你知道它的意思嗎？",
      "pinyin": "xiǎo tí dà zuò shì yí ge chéng yǔ nǐ zhī dào tā de yì si ma",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 3,
      "simplified": "先来听听这个故事。",
      "traditional": "先來聽聽這個故事。",
      "pinyin": "xiān lái tīng tīng zhè ge gù shi",
      "english": "“Making A Fuss Over Small Things” is an idiomatic expression; do you know what it means?"
    },
    {
      "index": 4,
      "simplified": "\n    ",
      "traditional": "\n    ",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "First listen to this story."
    },
    {
      "index": 5,
      "simplified": "小王做事很喜欢小题大做。",
      "traditional": "小王做事很喜歡小題大做。",
      "pinyin": "xiǎo wáng zuò shì hěn xǐ huan xiǎo tí dà zuò",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 6,
      "simplified": "有一次，他的手不小心被刀割破了，他吵着要去医院。",
      "traditional": "有一次，他的手不小心被刀割破了，他吵著要去醫院。",
      "pinyin": "yǒu yí cì tā de shǒu bù xiǎo xīn bèi dāo gē pò le tā chǎo zhe yào qù yī yuàn",
      "english": "Little Wang likes to make a fuss over little things."
    },
    {
      "index": 7,
      "simplified": "他的同事和他到了医院后，医生看着他的手很认真地说：",
      "traditional": "他的同事和他到了醫院後，醫生看著他的手很認真地說：",
      "pinyin": "tā de tóng shì hé tā dào le yī yuàn hòu yī shēng kàn zhe tā de shǒu hěn rèn zhēn de shuō",
      "english": "Once, he carelessly cut his hand on a blade, and shouted that he needed to go to a hospital."
    },
    {
      "index": 8,
      "simplified": "“还好你们来得早，再晚一点，你的手就好了。”",
      "traditional": "“還好你們來得早，再晚一點，你的手就好了。”",
      "pinyin": "hái hǎo nǐ men lái de zǎo zài wǎn yì diǎn nǐ de shǒu jiù hǎo le",
      "english": "After he and his coworker arrived at the hospital, the doctor looked at his hand and said earnestly:"
    },
    {
      "index": 9,
      "simplified": "\n    ",
      "traditional": "\n    ",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "“It's fortunate that you came so quickly. Had you arrived any later, your hand would have already healed.”"
    },
    {
      "index": 10,
      "simplified": "现在你知道“小题大做”的意思了吗？",
      "traditional": "現在你知道“小題大做”的意思了嗎？",
      "pinyin": "xiàn zài nǐ zhī dào xiǎo tí dà zuò de yì si le ma",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 11,
      "simplified": "“小题大做”是指把小事当作大事来办，",
      "traditional": "“小題大做”是指把小事當作大事來辦，",
      "pinyin": "xiǎo tí dà zuò shì zhǐ bǎ xiǎo shì dàng zuò dà shì lái bàn",
      "english": "Do you now know what “Making A Fuss Over Small Things” means?"
    },
    {
      "index": 12,
      "simplified": "有不值得这样做的意思。",
      "traditional": "有不值得這樣做的意思。",
      "pinyin": "yǒu bù zhí de zhè yàng zuò de yì si",
      "english": "“Making A Fuss Over Small Things” refers to taking something trivial and painting it as something major."
    },
    {
      "index": 13,
      "simplified": "",
      "traditional": "",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "It means that it's not worth making such a big deal out of something."
    }
  ],
